---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Impressum" description="The legally aspirational Impressum.">
  <article>
    <header class="post-head">
      <h1>Impressum</h1>
      <p class="post-meta">
        <span class="sq" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>angaben gemäß § just&#8209;in&#8209;case</span>
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Every German website is required by law to have an Impressum. This is
        not a German website, but it aspires to be taken for one, and nothing is
        more German than doing the paperwork voluntarily.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Verantwortlich für den Inhalt:</strong> the author, who also
        regrets the errors.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Datenschutz:</strong> this site sets no cookies, runs no
        analytics, and collects nothing. It doesn't even know you're here,
        which, frankly, is very un-German of it.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Haftungsausschluss:</strong> no liability is assumed for
        grammatical claims made below B1. They were made in good faith and in
        the wrong gender.
      </p>
      <p><strong>Bei Rückfragen:</strong> doch.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tombstone" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <nav class="post-foot">
      <a href="/">← Inhalt</a>
    </nav>
  </article>
</Base>
